Cell["\<\
CountSectorsRegulated computes the critical points of the regulated ideal, \
except for variables supplied in the third argument.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1914533785,ExpressionUUID->"1eacfa6d-5aec-4957-b8b2-02436df5b84d"],

Cell["\<\
With an empty third argument, the result is the expected number of master \
integrals without symmetries for the chosen polynomial.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->885746738,ExpressionUUID->"9994841f-184b-4d97-a63f-3d51d2817b33"],

Cell["\<\
This count is useful as a global check on sector-by-sector unregulated counts.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1460674880,ExpressionUUID->"83666ce0-11c0-4a04-b692-50c85cabd52d"],

Cell["\<\
The option \"UseSameRho\" -> True uses one shared rho parameter for all \
propagator exponents.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1450601731,ExpressionUUID->"3c0f3271-2726-4408-972f-9363b960ac48"],

